cause the Company to continue in full force and effect without modification all insurance policies, to the extent it has such policies
on the date hereof or on the Effective Date, except as required by applicable law;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 1.25in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

